  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 505.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to define the procedures and criteria for the establishment, designation, and redesignation of area agencies, and to define their role and responsibilities.\n\nSource. #1647, eff 10-14-80; ss by #2020, eff 5-11-82; ss by #2678, eff 4-18-84; ss by #4667, eff 8-25-89; ss by #4729, eff 1-15-90, EXPIRED: 1-15-96\n\nNew. #6871, eff 10-21-98; ss by #8728, INTERIM, eff 10-21-06, EXPIRED: 4-19-07\n\nNew. #8928, eff 6-30-07; ss by #10916, eff 8-26-15; ss by #13842, eff 12-29-23",
